  "description": "Async-first, unified data access for .NET 8 over SQL (PostgreSQL, CockroachDB, MySQL, SQL Server, SQLite) and NoSQL (Redis, in-memory) — covering ADO.NET-style access, the OmniDB ORM, caching, durable message queues, and pub/sub. This meta-package bundles OmniDataAccess.Core, OmniDataAccess.SqlDatabases, and OmniDataAccess.NoSqlDatabases, and adds HybridCacheManager (cache-aside over SQL) and an optional warm-up hosted service.",
